---
// EchoThread comment widget -- see https://echothread.io/docs/guides/astro
// Plain <script> tag, no client directive needed: Astro renders the HTML at
// build time and the widget self-initializes in the browser. Wired into
// recipe pages (src/pages/recipes/[slug].astro, pageId = bare collection id)
// and, as of Aug 16, 2026, blog posts (src/pages/blog/[slug].astro, pageId
// namespaced "blog/<id>" so a post and a recipe sharing a slug can never
// share a thread). Extend to Sami stories the same way if ever wanted --
// just pass a stable, namespaced pageId so comments survive URL changes.
//
// Sept 18, 2026 -- re-synced against the embed snippet EchoThread's own
// dashboard now generates for this site (confirmed live in Bruce's
// account), which has drifted from what's below in three ways:
//   1. <script> is missing `async`. Confirmed via network trace on the
//      live Larraburu post: widget.js itself loads fine, but the second
//      request it fires -- a hashed chunk like "widget.29a3b30019.js" --
//      resolved against the *page's own URL* instead of cdn.echothread.io,
//      producing a 503 (.../blog/<slug>/widget.<hash>.js instead of
//      https://cdn.echothread.io/widget.<hash>.js). That's why the
//      EchoThread dashboard showed the thread registering (12 threads
//      detected) while the actual comment UI never rendered. Matching
//      the dashboard's snippet (async added) is the fix.
//   2. data-theme is no longer a CSS-variable name -- current schema is
//      data-theme="light | dark | #hexcolor", with a separate
//      data-theme-source attribute for pointing at a host CSS variable.
//      "--color-bg" moved from data-theme to data-theme-source below.
//   3. data-page-title is no longer a listed/supported attribute -- the
//      pageTitle prop stays (harmless, could matter again later) but is
//      no longer rendered onto the div.
interface Props {
  pageId: string;
  pageTitle: string;
  pageUrl: string;
}
const { pageId, pageUrl } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="block" id="comments">
  <h2>Notes &amp; Comments</h2>
  <div
    id="echothread"
    data-shortname="brucesbreads"
    data-api-key="aFOvvte2nkPp4GnUyZBVsMuZD8GV9M2y2i1R3AZSc3I"
    data-page-url={pageUrl}
    data-identifier={pageId}
    data-theme="var(--crumb)"
    data-accent-color="var(--tomato)"
  ></div>
  <script src="https://cdn.echothread.io/widget.js" async></script>
</section>
